B.bnP=new A.ih("Be Concise but Thorough","Answer the question directly without rambling. Provide enough detail to demonstrate your expertise, using your STAR stories where appropriate.")
B.bnL=new A.ih("Show Enthusiasm","Express genuine interest in the role and the company. Smile and let your personality show.")
